    "rationale": "The language-neutral GTK embedding boundary is product-proven, but the foundation still combines a new shared-library host model with explicit non-default GtkApplication ownership. Submitting the complete surface now would be broad and impose an unrequested support commitment on Ghostty maintainers. Zentty will maintain the qualified fork while preparing only independently useful fixes for possible operator-approved upstream discussion.",
    "revisit_when": [
      "A non-Zentty consumer demonstrates generic demand for the embedding ABI.",
      "Ghostty maintainers indicate interest in owning an alternate GTK host boundary.",
      "The downstream series is reduced further without weakening Zentty behavior."
    ],
    "communication_requires_operator_approval": true,
    "rust_binding_in_ghostty": false
  },
